k display reconstruction: Lower Danube and Morava lowland approaches. Settlement slots follow connected river terraces, valley branches, foothill approaches, pasture and oasis/coastal margins. Natural Earth river geometries are retained under data/geography/natural-earth-rivers.source.geojson; smaller reference corridors remain explicitly reconstructed. Variable-width ribbons replace filled compact basin patches, and active channel cores / declared unsuitable patches / open water are excluded from terminal placement. Post-arrival dispersal takes 280 modeled calendar years along the supplied land-checked path; these are display assumptions, not source arrival dates or observed settlements. Path and dates are reconstructed."}}},"fixedAnnualRate":0.018349}
